        "raw": "<p>What happens if you use Entwined Power to gift Absorb Essence to a different spirit?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have no idea why you would want to do such a thing, but nonetheless, what happens when that spirit tries to play it?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>EDIT: &nbsp;Also, what about Ocean&#39;s power cards that drown Invaders?</p>",
