      {
        "id": 200413,
        "name": "Eric R",
        "username": "Eric_R",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/b9bd4f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-07-21T23:57:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Those are *excellent* questions!</p><blockquote><p><span>What happens if you use Entwined Power to gift Absorb Essence to a different spirit?</span></p></blockquote><p>You follow as much of the instructions as you can:</p><ul><li><strong>Gain 3 Energy</strong> - you can do this, so you do.</li><li><strong>Move 1 of target Spirit's Presence to your \"Deep Slumber\" track</strong> - you can't do this, because you don't have a Deep Slumber track.</li><li><strong>Absorbed Presence cannot be returned to play</strong> - you didn't Absorb any, so this is irrelevant.*</li><li><strong>Target Spirit gains Any Element and 1 Energy</strong> - you can do this, so you do.</li></ul><p>So the net effect is \"Gain 3 Energy. Target Spirit gains Any Element and 1 Energy.\"</p><p><em>* = The term \"Absorbed Presence\" isn't formally defined anywhere, but everybody understands what it means.</em></p><blockquote><p><span>Also, what about Ocean's power cards that drown Invaders?</span></p></blockquote><p>Ocean's Special Rules define what \"Drown\" means: \"Destroy Drowned pieces, placing Drowned Invaders here <em>[on Ocean's playmat]</em>.\" So if another player Drowns an Invader, it goes onto Ocean's playmat as usual.</p><p>It is, however, ambiguous whether it's Ocean or the other Spirit which actually performs the destruction, which while rarely relevant has the potential to be <em>(eg, if the other Spirit is Bringer of Dreams and Nightmares)</em>. I'll need to think on that, but I suspect it's the Power-using Spirit which performs the Destruction. (And that the last sentence of \"Ocean in Play\" ought to be reworded as \"You Drown any Invaders or [Dahan] moved to those Oceans.\" to make it clear that it's Ocean who's doing the Drowning in those cases.)</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:28:42.297Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
        "reads": 1,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 5.2,
